# The Sandstone Galleries' cave life (Prototypes/_WF/Caverns/Life/merak.yml).

wf-recipe-marrow-cap-soup = marrow cap soup recipe
wf-cave-snare-grabs = Roots burst out of the sand and close round your legs!
wf-cave-geode-cracks = The geode cracks and hums!
wf-cave-geode-bursts = The geode shatters into razor shards!
wf-cave-dustpod-puff = The pod bursts in a cloud of stinging dust!

ent-WFGalleryAloe = gallery aloe
    .desc = Thick, sappy leaves from a cave aloe. Eat them to ease cuts and burns, or cut them up to bind on a wound.
ent-WFMarrowCapMushroom = marrow cap
    .desc = A pale cap that grows out of old bone. Cook two in a big bowl with water for a soup.
ent-WFFoodSoupMarrowCap = marrow cap soup
    .desc = A rich, creamy soup of marrow caps.
ent-WFGravebloomPetals = gravebloom petals
    .desc = Pale petals from the ruin quarter. They're safe to eat and ease the breathing.

ent-WFCaveGalleryAloe = gallery aloe
    .desc = A fleshy aloe in the cave sand. Pick it for a healing herb; it grows back.
ent-WFCaveSandSnare = sand snare
    .desc = Dry roots lie just under the sand here and close round the legs of anyone who walks over them. Cut them or struggle free.
ent-WFCaveMarrowCap = marrow caps
    .desc = Pale mushrooms growing out of the bone beds. They're good to eat, and they grow back after picking.
ent-WFCaveBrittleGeode = brittle geode
    .desc = A geode of glass-thin amber crystal. It cracks when someone stands near it and bursts into razor shards. Shoot it from afar.
ent-WFCaveGravebloom = gravebloom
    .desc = A pale violet flower that grows on the old stones of the ruin quarter. Pick it for its petals; it grows back.
ent-WFCaveDustPod = dust pod
    .desc = A dry, papery pod full of stinging dust. Brush against it and it bursts.

ent-WFMobPallidSandviper = pallid sandviper
    .desc = A white cobra with amber eyes, coiled in the bones. It has never needed colour.
ent-WFMobDustBat = dust bat
    .desc = A sand-coloured bat that roosts in the pillars and dives at the lamplight.
ent-WFMobGalleryCrab = gallery crab
    .desc = A sandstone-yellow crab that scuttles through the halls. Its claw is stronger than it looks.
ent-WFMobCryptTick = crypt tick
    .desc = A bloodless tick the colour of old bone. It has been waiting a long time for something to bite.
